# dev-symlink.map — "edition live" montage between plugin cache installs and
# dev repos. Copy to ~/.claude/dev-symlink.map (or point DEV_SYMLINK_MAP at
# a copy) and keep it updated: plugin versions change on every install/update,
# so the cache path's version segment below WILL go stale — update the line
# after each `claude plugin install`/`update` rather than trusting this file.
#
# Format: <cache_install_dir>|<dev_repo_dir>|<mode>
#   mode = tree                          (symlink every top-level entry) or
#   mode = <relative binary path>        (symlink just that one path)
#
# Verified against the live montage on 2026-07-13 (see memory:
# dev-symlink-montage.md); plugin/marketplace keys and dev-repo dirs refreshed
# 2026-08-10 for the automatised-pipeline / prd-spec-generator / cortex-viz
# renames plus the earlier cortex -> hypermnesia-mcp plugin-key rename (the
# mirror dir `Cortex-live` no longer exists on disk). Update the version
# segments after each release.

